{{Classic Era}}
A mount is summoned by clicking a bridle (horses), a drum (Drogmors) or a set of reins. Every one is Slot: AMMO, all classes, all races, No Trade. The material or size sets the speed; the colour is only the look. The full list is [[:Category:Mounts]].

== Horses ==
Bridles cast [[Summon Horse]]. Sold by [[Stable Hand Brack]] ([[East Freeport]], right past the gate, -163, -725), [[Stable Hand Kaye]] ([[North Qeynos]], west of the gate, outside, 201, 572) and [[Stable Hand V`Shal]] ([[Lake Nerius]], -255, 301).

